        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Elmont, New York\n- Organizations: Belmont Park\n- Events: Belmont Stakes\n- Concepts: Thoroughbred horse racing\n- People: Vice Regent\n\nFacts:\n- Belmont Park is an American horse race facility in Elmont, New York, and it opened on May 4, 1905.\n- Vice Regent was an example of the Thoroughbred breed type.\n- Belmont Park specializes in Thoroughbred horse racing.\n- The Belmont Stakes takes place at Belmont Park every June.\n- Starting in 2016, the Belmont Stakes has a $500,000 purse.",
